      "cooked": "<p>The new app update has a serious problem.</p><p>The card Checmical Explosion has been changed to Chemical Explosion.</p><p>Obviously GtG has bowed to political pressures on this one, becoming more politically correct and aiding in the international conspiracy to downplay the dangers of checmicals and their explosions.</p><p>I call on all citizens of the Multiverse to rally together to resist this censorship and obfuscation of important issues by the government and mass media!</p><p>Lets make whatever week this currently is (who can know with \"leap days\" and \"daylight savings time\" manipulating the calendar) Checmical Acwareness week. &nbsp;Add a c into appropriate words, lets take back the truth, and add a c for every one they silence!</p>",
